      "values:originalText": "item 44\nImmediately after the commencement of the\nprovision(s) covered by table item 2.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if item 9 of Schedule 2 to the Access to\nJustice (Federal Jurisdiction) Amendment\nAct 2012 does not commence at or before\nthe time Schedule 1 to this Act commences.",
      "skos:definition": "item 44\nImmediately after the commencement of the\nprovision(s) covered by table item 2.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if item 9 of Schedule 2 to the Access to\nJustice (Federal Jurisdiction) Amendment\nAct 2012 does not commence at or before\nthe time Schedule 1 to this Act commences.",
      "cml:asserts": [
