      "dc:source": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(3) In this section:\nthe Federal Circuit Court of Australia or a Judge has the same\nmeaning as in the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(3) In this section:\nthe Federal Circuit Court of Australia or a Judge has the same\nmeaning as in the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999.",
