      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6A Effect of change of name of Federal Magistrates Court",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "To the extent that this Part applies after the commencement of\nSchedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation\nAmendment Act 2012:\n\n(a) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Act 1999 is\ntaken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of\nAustralia Act 1999; and\n\n(b) a reference in this Part to the Federal Magistrates Court is\ntaken to include a reference to the Federal Circuit Court of\nAustralia."
    },
