    {
      "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-320",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "320 Saving provision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013#sch-1-sec-320"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "Schedule 1  Main amendments\n\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing\nofficer, under the Greenhouse and Energy Minimum Standards Act\n2012 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that\ncommencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of\nthe Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that\nAct.\nIndependent Contractors Act 2006",
      "skos:definition": "Schedule 1  Main amendments\n\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing\nofficer, under the Greenhouse and Energy Minimum Standards Act\n2012 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that\ncommencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of\nthe Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that\nAct.\nIndependent Contractors Act 2006",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-320-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2e65adce47263b05127ccbfb2031ed45f7ca3fa6a496e95a514d875c6f4cf21d",
      "skos:note": "Saving provision for actions taken before commencement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013#sch-1-sec-320",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "320 Saving provision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "Schedule 1  Main amendments\n\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a Federal Magistrate, as an issuing\nofficer, under the Greenhouse and Energy Minimum Standards Act\n2012 before the commencement of this item has effect, after that\ncommencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, a Judge of\nthe Federal Circuit Court of Australia, as an issuing officer, under that\nAct.\nIndependent Contractors Act 2006"
    },
