    {
      "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-495",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "495 Saving provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013#sch-1-sec-495"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA consent that is in force immediately before the commencement of this\nitem under subsection 87(1) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a consent in respect of a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia.\n(2)\nA nomination that is in force immediately before the commencement of\nthis item under subsection 87(2) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a nomination in respect of a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia.\n(3)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a magistrate under Division 2 of\nPart 6 of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 before the commencement\nof this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done\nby, or in relation to, an issuing officer under that Division.\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRenewable Energy (Electricity) Act 2000",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nA consent that is in force immediately before the commencement of this\nitem under subsection 87(1) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a consent in respect of a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia.\n(2)\nA nomination that is in force immediately before the commencement of\nthis item under subsection 87(2) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a nomination in respect of a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia.\n(3)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a magistrate under Division 2 of\nPart 6 of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 before the commencement\nof this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done\nby, or in relation to, an issuing officer under that Division.\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRenewable Energy (Electricity) Act 2000",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-495-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "55830a68bc2226bba8649ed65a6c3457ad88836755f7833c7a2d069b6a02cb95",
      "skos:note": "Consent and nomination continuity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013#sch-1-sec-495",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "495 Saving provisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nA consent that is in force immediately before the commencement of this\nitem under subsection 87(1) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a consent in respect of a Judge of the Federal Circuit\nCourt of Australia.\n(2)\nA nomination that is in force immediately before the commencement of\nthis item under subsection 87(2) of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 in\nrespect of a Federal Magistrate continues in force, after that\ncommencement, as a nomination in respect of a Judge of the Federal\nCircuit Court of Australia.\n(3)\nA thing done by, or in relation to, a magistrate under Division 2 of\nPart 6 of the Product Stewardship Act 2011 before the commencement\nof this item has effect, after that commencement, as if it had been done\nby, or in relation to, an issuing officer under that Division.\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nRenewable Energy (Electricity) Act 2000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-495-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013-sch-1-sec-495"
      },
