      "skos:note": "Commencement of provisions in Schedule 1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013#sch-3-sec-2-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Schedule 1,",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "items 1 to 186\nA single day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if the provision(s) do not\ncommence within the period of 6 months\nbeginning on the day this Act receives the\nRoyal Assent, they commence on the day\nafter the end of that period."
    },
