      "values:originalText": "Omit “Federal Magistrate within the meaning of the Federal\nMagistrates Act 1999”, substitute “Judge within the meaning of the\nFederal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999”.\n\n\nContingent amendments  Schedule 3\nCourts Legislation Amendment (Judicial Complaints) Act 2012  Part 4",
