      "dc:source": "federal-circuit-court-of-australia-consequential-amendments-act-2013.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nFor the purposes of the operation of an Appropriation Act after this\nSchedule commences, references to the Federal Magistrates Court of\nAustralia are to be read as references to the Federal Circuit Court of\nAustralia.\n(2)\nIn this item:\nAppropriation Act means an Act appropriating money for expenditure\nout of the Consolidated Revenue Fund.",
